<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY OCT JOBLESS RATE DOWN TO 10.8 PCT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY OCT JOBLESS RATE DOWN TO 10.8 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's unemployement rate</p>
<p>fell to 10.8 percent in October from 11.0 percent in September,</p>
<p>the National Labour Centre (OMK) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    HUNGARY JOBLESS	    Oct 96    Sept 96    Oct 95</p>
<p>    registered unemployed   494,331    501,102   479,100</p>
<p>    rate (pct)		     10.8	 11.0	10.0</p>
<p>NOTE - All percentage figures are based on size of the</p>
<p>active population in January 1995.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
